  "title": "Graco Announces Regular Quarterly Dividend",
  "summary": "MINNEAPOLIS --(BUSINESS WIRE)--Jun. 12, 2026-- The Board of Directors of Graco Inc. (NYSE:GGG) has declared a regular quarterly dividend of 29.5 cents ( $0.295) per common share, payable on August 5, 2026, to shareholders of record at the close of business on July 20, 2026.",
